### Login admin
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@biblioteca.com", "password": "123456" }

### Login atendente antigo
# @name loginAtendente
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "atendente@biblioteca.com", "password": "123456" }

### Criar atendente sem token (esperado 401)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/user
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Carlos", "username": "carlos", "email": "carlos@biblioteca.com", "password": "123456" }

### Criar atendente como atendente (esperado 403)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/user
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAtendente.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "name": "Carlos", "username": "carlos", "email": "carlos@biblioteca.com", "password": "123456" }

### Criar atendente como admin (esperado 201, e sem password na resposta)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/user
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "name": "Carlos", "username": "carlos", "email": "carlos@biblioteca.com", "password": "123456" }

### Login do Carlos
# @name loginCarlos
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "carlos@biblioteca.com", "password": "123456" }

### Desativar o Carlos (esperado 200, active false)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/v1/user/{{loginCarlos.response.body.user.id}}/active
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "active": false }

### Login do Carlos desativado (esperado 403)
POST http://localhost:3000/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "carlos@biblioteca.com", "password": "123456" }

### Reativar o Carlos (esperado 200, active true)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/v1/user/{{loginCarlos.response.body.user.id}}/active
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "active": true }

### Editar o Carlos (esperado 200)
PUT http://localhost:3000/v1/user/{{loginCarlos.response.body.user.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "name": "Carlos Eduardo" }

### Admin tenta se desativar (esperado 400)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/v1/user/{{loginAdmin.response.body.user.id}}/active
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

{ "active": false }

### Listar usuários como admin (esperado 200, sem password)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/user
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### Listar usuários como atendente (esperado 403)
GET http://localhost:3000/v1/user
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAtendente.response.body.accessToken}}
